    Main Chiller,                  !- Component 1 Name
    CHW Chiller Inlet Node,        !- Component 1 Inlet Node Name
    CHW Chiller Outlet Node;       !- Component 1 Outlet Node Name


Branch,
    CHW Supply Bypass Branch,      !- Name
